#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:1
msgid "What's New in FlagOS 2.2"
msgstr "FlagOS 2.2 新特性"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:3
msgid ""
"FlagOS 2.2 upgrades the multi-chip software stack across model training, "
"inference, operator optimization, and deployment. It strengthens "
"framework and backend integration, expands compiler and operator "
"capabilities, and adds new toolchains for ARM CPU inference, model "
"quantization, kernel development, and large-model delivery."
msgstr ""
"FlagOS 2.2 升级了覆盖模型训练、推理、算子优化和部署的多芯片软件栈。它强化了框架与后端集成，扩展了编译器和算子能力，并新增面向 ARM CPU "
"推理、模型量化、内核开发和大模型交付的工具链。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:5
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:7
msgid ""
"**Framework integrations:** Updates to vLLM-Plugin-FL and SGLang-Plugin-"
"FL, and the first FlagOS integration for PyTorch through Torch-FL."
msgstr ""
"**框架集成：** 更新 vLLM-Plugin-FL 和 SGLang-Plugin-FL，并通过 Torch-FL 首次提供面向 "
"PyTorch 的 FlagOS 集成。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:8
msgid ""
"**Training stack:** Updates to Megatron-LM-FL, TransformerEngine-FL, and "
"FlagScale for model training and lifecycle management."
msgstr "**训练栈：** 面向模型训练和生命周期管理，更新 Megatron-LM-FL、TransformerEngine-FL 和 FlagScale。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:9
msgid ""
"**Operator and compiler tooling:** Expanded operator coverage, new "
"SGLang-specific operators, compiler and auto-tuning improvements, and "
"additional routing options."
msgstr "**算子与编译器工具：** 扩展算子覆盖范围，新增 SGLang 专用算子，改进编译器与自动调优能力，并增加更多路由选项。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:10
msgid ""
"**ARM CPU inference:** First release of FlagTree-CPU as an independent "
"compilation component for low-bit ARM64 workloads."
msgstr "**ARM CPU 推理：** 首次发布 FlagTree-CPU，作为面向低比特 ARM64 工作负载的独立编译组件。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:11
msgid ""
"**Model conversion:** First release of FlagOS-Compressor for weight "
"conversion and W4A16, W8A16, and dynamic W8A8 workflows."
msgstr "**模型转换：** 首次发布 FlagOS-Compressor，用于权重转换以及 W4A16、W8A16 和动态 W8A8 工作流。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:12
msgid ""
"**Kernel development:** First release of FlagPrism for cross-backend "
"Triton debugging and profiling."
msgstr "**内核开发：** 首次发布 FlagPrism，用于跨后端 Triton 调试与性能分析。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:13
msgid ""
"**Model delivery:** Additional Day 0 model adaptations, deployment "
"configurations, and model images through FlagRelease."
msgstr "**模型交付：** 通过 FlagRelease 提供更多 Day 0 模型适配、部署配置和模型镜像。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:15
msgid "Runtime and framework integrations"
msgstr "运行时与框架集成"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:17
msgid "vLLM-Plugin-FL"
msgstr "vLLM-Plugin-FL"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:19
msgid ""
"vLLM-Plugin-FL adds the following capabilities for the FlagOS multi-chip "
"backend:"
msgstr "vLLM-Plugin-FL 为 FlagOS 多芯片后端新增以下能力："

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:21
msgid "Compatibility lines for vLLM 0.20.2 and 0.24.0."
msgstr "面向 vLLM 0.20.2 和 0.24.0 的兼容性分支。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:22
msgid ""
"An expanded **Empty** deployment mode that separates framework "
"construction from device-specific implementation."
msgstr "扩展后的 **Empty** 部署模式，将框架构建与设备特定实现解耦。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:23
msgid "INT8 and W8A8 execution paths."
msgstr "INT8 和 W8A8 执行路径。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:24
msgid "Graph execution support for selected non-NVIDIA backends."
msgstr "面向部分非 NVIDIA 后端的图执行支持。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:25
msgid "Monitoring for key-value (KV) cache transfers."
msgstr "键值（KV）缓存传输监控。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:27
msgid ""
"These features are intended to let the plugin provide device integration,"
" operators, and communication implementations without requiring each "
"model application to change its standard vLLM interface."
msgstr "这些特性旨在让插件提供设备集成、算子和通信实现，而无需每个模型应用修改其标准 vLLM 接口。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:29
msgid "SGLang-Plugin-FL"
msgstr "SGLang-Plugin-FL"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:31
msgid ""
"SGLang-Plugin-FL expands backend integration for the SGLang runtime "
"across Hygon, Iluvatar CoreX, BANG, Kunlunxin, and Enflame backends."
msgstr "SGLang-Plugin-FL 扩展了 SGLang 运行时在海光、天数智芯 CoreX、BANG、昆仑芯和燧原后端上的集成。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:33
msgid "The update also adds or improves:"
msgstr "本次更新还新增或改进了："

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:35
msgid "The Empty deployment path."
msgstr "Empty 部署路径。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:36
msgid "Pipeline-parallel communication."
msgstr "流水线并行通信。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:37
msgid "Separate prefill and decode KV transfer paths."
msgstr "独立的 prefill 与 decode KV 传输路径。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:38
msgid "Multi-token prediction (MTP) integration."
msgstr "多 token 预测（MTP）集成。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:39
msgid "Integration with the new FlagGems-SGLang operator library."
msgstr "与新的 FlagGems-SGLang 算子库集成。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:41
msgid "Torch-FL"
msgstr "Torch-FL"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:43
msgid ""
"Torch-FL is introduced as the FlagOS PyTorch adaptation path. It provides"
" a unified virtual device named `FlagOS` and routes operators to FlagOS, "
"vendor implementations, or compatible fallback paths."
msgstr ""
"Torch-FL 作为 FlagOS 的 PyTorch 适配路径引入。它提供名为 `FlagOS` 的统一虚拟设备，并将算子路由到 "
"FlagOS、厂商实现或兼容的回退路径。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:45
msgid "The initial release focuses on:"
msgstr "初始版本重点包括："

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:47
msgid "Multi-chip PyTorch execution."
msgstr "多芯片 PyTorch 执行。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:48
msgid "Mixed-precision and distributed execution paths."
msgstr "混合精度与分布式执行路径。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:49
msgid "Compiler integration."
msgstr "编译器集成。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:50
msgid ""
"Backend additions for Hygon, Moore Threads, BANG, and Enflame "
"environments."
msgstr "新增面向海光、摩尔线程、BANG 和燧原环境的后端支持。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:51
msgid "Integration with FlagGems and vendor operator implementations."
msgstr "与 FlagGems 及厂商算子实现集成。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:53
msgid ""
"Torch-FL also supports running Qwen-Image-2.1 with a standard Diffusers "
"interface while moving text encoding, denoising, and image decoding to "
"the CPU."
msgstr "Torch-FL 还支持通过标准 Diffusers 接口运行 Qwen-Image-2.1，同时将文本编码、去噪和图像解码迁移到 CPU 执行。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:55
msgid "Training stack and FlagScale"
msgstr "训练栈与 FlagScale"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:57
msgid "The training-side updates include:"
msgstr "训练侧更新包括："

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:59
msgid "Megatron-LM-FL updated to MCore 0.18.2."
msgstr "Megatron-LM-FL 更新至 MCore 0.18.2。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:60
msgid "TransformerEngine-FL updated to Transformer Engine 2.17."
msgstr "TransformerEngine-FL 更新至 Transformer Engine 2.17。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:61
msgid ""
"Adaptation work for GLM5 DSA, fused RoPE, block-wise cross-entropy, and "
"backend-specific execution paths."
msgstr "面向 GLM5 DSA、融合 RoPE、分块交叉熵以及后端特定执行路径的适配工作。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:62
msgid ""
"FlagScale improvements for slow-node detection, training performance "
"monitoring, progress heartbeats, and weight conversion."
msgstr "FlagScale 改进了慢节点检测、训练性能监控、进度心跳和权重转换。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:64
msgid ""
"These updates improve the observability and portability of multi-chip "
"training jobs."
msgstr "这些更新提升了多芯片训练任务的可观测性和可移植性。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:66
msgid "Operators and compilation"
msgstr "算子与编译"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:68
msgid "Operator library updates"
msgstr "算子库更新"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:70
msgid ""
"FlagOS 2.2 expands operator coverage for general-purpose, fused, and "
"domain-specific libraries. The release includes operators and execution "
"paths for attention, Mamba state updates, mixture-of-experts (MoE) "
"workloads, LoRA, sampling, quantization, MLA, KDA/GLA/GDN2, TopK, and "
"low-precision computation."
msgstr ""
"FlagOS 2.2 扩展了通用、融合和领域专用算子库的覆盖范围。本版本包含面向 attention、Mamba "
"状态更新、混合专家（MoE）工作负载、LoRA、采样、量化、MLA、KDA/GLA/GDN2、TopK 和低精度计算的算子与执行路径。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:72
msgid ""
"The release also introduces **FlagGems-SGLang** as an SGLang-oriented "
"operator library and updates **FlagGems-vLLM** with additional vLLM "
"operator entry points. Operator totals use component-specific scopes and "
"counting methods, so this page does not publish one aggregate total "
"without a matching version, backend matrix, and counting method."
msgstr ""
"本版本还引入面向 SGLang 的算子库 **FlagGems-SGLang**，并为 **FlagGems-vLLM** 更新更多 vLLM "
"算子入口。算子总数采用组件特定的范围和统计方法，因此在没有匹配的版本、后端矩阵和统计方法时，本页不发布单一汇总总数。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:74
msgid "Compiler and auto-tuning improvements"
msgstr "编译器与自动调优改进"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:76
msgid ""
"The compiler and runtime changes target data movement, kernel launch "
"overhead, synchronization, and shape-dependent execution. The release "
"includes:"
msgstr "编译器和运行时变更聚焦于数据移动、内核启动开销、同步以及依赖形状的执行。本版本包括："

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:78
msgid "Optional NVIDIA TileIR compilation paths."
msgstr "可选的 NVIDIA TileIR 编译路径。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:79
msgid "TLE-based layout, shared-memory, and asynchronous-pipeline control."
msgstr "基于 TLE 的布局、共享内存和异步流水线控制。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:80
msgid "FlagTune search for execution configurations."
msgstr "用于执行配置搜索的 FlagTune。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:81
msgid "Operator fusion and mixed-precision paths."
msgstr "算子融合和混合精度路径。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:82
msgid "Shape-aware routing to select an execution path for a given input."
msgstr "感知形状的路由，用于为给定输入选择执行路径。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:83
msgid "Additional compiler and backend integration work in FlagTree."
msgstr "FlagTree 中新增的编译器与后端集成工作。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:85
msgid "ARM CPU inference with FlagTree-CPU"
msgstr "使用 FlagTree-CPU 进行 ARM CPU 推理"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:87
msgid ""
"FlagTree-CPU v0.1.0 is introduced as an independent compilation component"
" for CPU targets. The release is based on `triton-cpu 3.7.2` and adds "
"ARM64 compilation paths for:"
msgstr ""
"FlagTree-CPU v0.1.0 作为面向 CPU 目标的独立编译组件引入。本版本基于 `triton-cpu 3.7.2`，并新增以下 "
"ARM64 编译路径："

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:89
msgid "SME2."
msgstr "SME2。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:90
msgid "SVE2."
msgstr "SVE2。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:91
msgid "NEON I8MM."
msgstr "NEON I8MM。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:93
msgid ""
"The component generates low-bit operator instructions for W4A8 and W8A8 "
"workloads. In the FlagOS deployment path, FlagTree-CPU works with "
"FlagGems ARM operators and vLLM-Plugin-FL to support ARM CPU inference."
msgstr ""
"该组件为 W4A8 和 W8A8 工作负载生成低比特算子指令。在 FlagOS 部署路径中，FlagTree-CPU 与 FlagGems ARM "
"算子和 vLLM-Plugin-FL 配合，以支持 ARM CPU 推理。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:95
msgid ""
"The inference stack adds weight pre-packing, operator fusion, compiled-"
"kernel reuse, prefill matrix multiplication, decode-time weight access, "
"and single-stream scheduling."
msgstr "推理栈新增权重预打包、算子融合、已编译内核复用、prefill 矩阵乘法、decode 阶段权重访问和单流调度。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:97
msgid "Quantization and model compression"
msgstr "量化与模型压缩"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:99
msgid "FlagOS-Compressor"
msgstr "FlagOS-Compressor"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:101
msgid ""
"FlagOS-Compressor is introduced as a cross-backend weight conversion and "
"quantization tool. It reads Hugging Face `safetensors` checkpoints and "
"provides a workflow for selecting modules, converting weights, exporting "
"deployment artifacts, and validating the resulting tensors and "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"FlagOS-Compressor 作为跨后端权重转换与量化工具引入。它读取 Hugging Face `safetensors` "
"检查点，并提供用于选择模块、转换权重、导出部署产物以及验证输出张量和配置的工作流。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:103
msgid "The release describes the following quantization schemes:"
msgstr "本版本描述了以下量化方案："

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:105
msgid "**W4A16:** INT4 weights with 16-bit activations."
msgstr "**W4A16：** INT4 权重与 16 位激活。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:106
msgid "**W8A16:** INT8 weights with 16-bit activations."
msgstr "**W8A16：** INT8 权重与 16 位激活。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:107
msgid "**Dynamic W8A8:** INT8 weights with per-token dynamic INT8 activations."
msgstr "**动态 W8A8：** INT8 权重与按 token 动态计算的 INT8 激活。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:109
msgid ""
"The quantization scope can be selected by module, including attention, "
"MLP, MoE experts, shared experts, vision encoders, embeddings, "
"normalization, and routing gates. Exported artifacts include quantized "
"weights, scale parameters, shard indexes, runtime configuration, and "
"integrity checks. The exported weight format is `compressed-tensors`."
msgstr ""
"量化范围可按模块选择，包括 attention、MLP、MoE experts、shared experts、vision "
"encoders、embeddings、normalization 和 routing gates。导出的产物包括量化权重、scale "
"参数、分片索引、运行时配置和完整性检查。导出的权重格式为 `compressed-tensors`。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:111
msgid "Large-model deployment"
msgstr "大模型部署"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:113
msgid ""
"FlagOS 2.2 adds large-model deployment support through INT8 and W8A8 "
"quantization paths, deployment artifacts, and configurations for BANG, "
"Ascend, Hygon, NVIDIA, and PPU environments."
msgstr ""
"FlagOS 2.2 通过 INT8 和 W8A8 量化路径、部署产物以及面向 BANG、昇腾、海光、NVIDIA 和 PPU "
"环境的配置，新增大模型部署支持。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:115
msgid "Triton debugging and profiling with FlagPrism"
msgstr "使用 FlagPrism 进行 Triton 调试与性能分析"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:117
msgid ""
"FlagPrism is introduced as a cross-backend Triton debugger and profiler "
"integrated with FlagTree. It connects Triton source code, compiler IR "
"operations, and device execution events into one observation workflow."
msgstr ""
"FlagPrism 作为与 FlagTree 集成的跨后端 Triton 调试器和性能分析器引入。它将 Triton 源代码、编译器 IR "
"操作和设备执行事件连接到一个观测工作流中。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:119
msgid "The Debugger can collect:"
msgstr "Debugger 可以采集："

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:121
msgid "Intermediate values from selected regions of a `@triton.jit` kernel."
msgstr "`@triton.jit` 内核所选区域中的中间值。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:122
msgid "Numerical summaries."
msgstr "数值摘要。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:123
msgid "Memory addresses."
msgstr "内存地址。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:124
msgid "Complete tensor data."
msgstr "完整张量数据。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:125
msgid "Source- and IR-level locations associated with collected values."
msgstr "与所采集值关联的源码级和 IR 级位置。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:127
msgid "The Profiler can collect or derive:"
msgstr "Profiler 可以采集或推导："

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:129
msgid "Call context and execution timelines."
msgstr "调用上下文和执行时间线。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:130
msgid "Operation counts."
msgstr "操作计数。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:131
msgid "Estimated memory traffic."
msgstr "估算的内存流量。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:132
msgid "Hardware metrics and vendor profiler data where available."
msgstr "可用时的硬件指标和厂商 profiler 数据。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:133
msgid "Aggregated call-tree and timeline reports."
msgstr "聚合的调用树和时间线报告。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:135
msgid ""
"FlagPrism uses a unified test set of 121 Triton operators and targets "
"NVIDIA, Ascend, Iluvatar CoreX, Moore Threads, and Enflame backends. "
"Debugger and profiler capabilities may differ between backends because "
"collection is implemented by backend-specific adapters."
msgstr ""
"FlagPrism 使用包含 121 个 Triton 算子的统一测试集，并面向 NVIDIA、昇腾、天数智芯 "
"CoreX、摩尔线程和燧原后端。由于采集由后端特定适配器实现，不同后端之间的调试器和性能分析器能力可能存在差异。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:137
msgid "Kernel generation and evaluation"
msgstr "内核生成与评测"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:139
msgid ""
"FlagOS 2.2 continues the KernelGen workflow for generating and validating"
" operator implementations. In the stated quarterly period, KernelGen "
"generated 1,509 operators and 1,231 operators passed accuracy validation."
" The FlagGems release comparison also includes 436 KernelGen-tagged pull "
"requests; these are different measures and should not be added together."
msgstr ""
"FlagOS 2.2 延续了用于生成和验证算子实现的 KernelGen 工作流。在所述季度周期内，KernelGen 生成 1,509 个算子，其中 "
"1,231 个通过精度验证。FlagGems 发布对比还包含 436 个带有 KernelGen 标签的 pull "
"request；这些是不同统计口径，不应相加。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:141
msgid ""
"KernelGenBench v0.2.0 adds multi-chip baselines, chip identification, "
"token-usage analysis, and anti-cheating checks. It also adds 50 matrix-"
"multiplication shapes in two precisions, for 100 benchmark cases in that "
"release."
msgstr ""
"KernelGenBench v0.2.0 新增多芯片 baseline、芯片识别、token 使用分析和防作弊检查。该版本还新增 50 "
"个矩阵乘形状、两种精度，共 100 个基准用例。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:143
msgid "Day 0 models and deployment resources"
msgstr "Day 0 模型与部署资源"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:145
msgid ""
"FlagOS 2.2 adds seven Day 0 model adaptations, with a single model "
"covering up to 12 platforms or devices in the release inventory."
msgstr "FlagOS 2.2 新增七个 Day 0 模型适配；在发布清单中，单个模型最多覆盖 12 个平台或设备。"

#: ../../flagos_homepage/whats_new.md:147
msgid ""
"FlagRelease provides more than 300 model images through public release "
"channels. The available image, model-card, and deployment configuration "
"should be checked in the relevant channel before use because platform "
"coverage varies by model."
msgstr "FlagRelease 通过公开发布渠道提供 300 多个模型镜像。由于平台覆盖范围因模型而异，使用前应在相关渠道检查可用镜像、模型卡和部署配置。"
#~ msgid ""
#~ "FlagOS 2.2 extends the shared software"
#~ " stack for multi-chip model training"
#~ " and inference. This release adds new"
#~ " framework integrations and developer "
#~ "tools, expands operator and compiler "
#~ "capabilities, introduces an Arm CPU "
#~ "compilation path, and publishes additional "
#~ "quantization and model deployment resources."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "FlagOS 2.2 "
#~ "扩展了面向多芯片模型训练与推理的共享软件栈。本版本新增框架集成与开发者工具，扩展算子和编译器能力，引入 Arm "
#~ "CPU 编译路径，并发布更多量化与模型部署资源。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The results in this page are "
#~ "release examples rather than universal "
#~ "performance or compatibility guarantees. "
#~ "Support and benchmark results depend on"
