#~ msgid ""
#~ "**TopK on NVIDIA A100:** For an "
#~ "input shape of `[64, 129280]` and "
#~ "`k=1024`, the reported runtime decreased "
#~ "from `0.353280 ms` for the non-TLE"
#~ " FlagGems implementation to `0.130048 ms`,"
#~ " or approximately `2.717x` faster in "
#~ "that test."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**NVIDIA A100 上的 TopK：** 对于输入形状 `[64,"
#~ " 129280]` 和 `k=1024`，报告运行时间从非 TLE FlagGems"
#~ " 实现的 `0.353280 ms` 降至 `0.130048 "
#~ "ms`，在该测试中约快 `2.717x`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**KDA on NVIDIA H800:** For BF16 "
#~ "with `K=V=128`, `BT=16`, and the stated"
#~ " two-stage configuration, the reported "
#~ "geometric-mean result was approximately "
#~ "`1.380x` relative to the FlashKDA "
#~ "comparison."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**NVIDIA H800 上的 KDA：** 对于 "
#~ "BF16、`K=V=128`、`BT=16` 以及所述两阶段配置，报告的几何平均结果相对于 FlashKDA "
#~ "对比约为 `1.380x`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Hy3 on NVIDIA H20:** With eight "
#~ "NVIDIA H20 141 GB GPUs and "
#~ "concurrency 64, selected FlagGems operators"
#~ " produced reported throughput improvements "
#~ "of 7.2%, 4.6%, and 3.2% for 4K/1K,"
#~ " 16K/1K, and 32K/1K input/output lengths,"
#~ " respectively. The test retained four "
#~ "selected operators and used native vLLM"
#~ " implementations for the remaining "
#~ "operators."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**NVIDIA H20 上的 Hy3：** 使用 8 张 "
#~ "NVIDIA H20 141 GB GPU、并发数为 64 时，所选"
#~ " FlagGems 算子在 4K/1K、16K/1K 和 32K/1K "
#~ "输入/输出长度下分别带来 7.2%%、4.6%% 和 3.2%% "
#~ "的报告吞吐提升。该测试保留了四个所选算子，并对其余算子使用原生 vLLM 实现。"

